Section: 5.1 Dataset and Setting
Text: Data statistics are given in Table 1. WQT dataset WTQ dataset # of tables 273,816 2,108 Avg # of columns 4.55 6.38 Max # of columns 52 25 Min # of columns 1 3 Avg # of rows 9.15 28.50 Max # of rows 1,517 754 Min # of rows 2 5 # of questions 21,113 22,033 4.61 11.25 Avg # of questions Table 1: Statistics of WebQueryTable (WQT) dataset and WikiTableQuestions (WTQ) dataset. We sampled 200 examples to analyze the dis- tribution of the query types in our dataset.

